{"ref":"BDB Aramaic, קֶ֫רֶן","hw":"קֶ֫רֶן","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">קֶ֫רֶן</span></big>  <strong>n.f.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">Dn 7:8</a></sup> <strong>horn (</strong>v. BH <a data-ref=\"BDB, קרן\" href=\"/BDB,_קרן\", dir=\"rtl\">קרן</a><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">Dn 7:8</a>; emph. <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְנָא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:5\" href=\"/Daniel.3.5\">3:5</a> +; du. (often!) <span dir=\"rtl\">קַרְ֫נַיִן</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>; emph. -<span dir=\"rtl\">נַיָּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">7:8</a> +;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  instr. of music, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:5\" href=\"/Daniel.3.5\">Dn 3:5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:7\" href=\"/Daniel.3.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:10\" href=\"/Daniel.3.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 3:15\" href=\"/Daniel.3.15\">15</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  symbolic, in vision, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:7\" href=\"/Daniel.7.7\">7:7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:8\" href=\"/Daniel.7.8\">8</a><sup>(×3)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:11\" href=\"/Daniel.7.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:20\" href=\"/Daniel.7.20\">20</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:21\" href=\"/Daniel.7.21\">21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Daniel 7:24\" href=\"/Daniel.7.24\">24</a>.","next":"BDB Aramaic, קְרַץ","prev":"BDB Aramaic, קִרְיָה"}